# U36: AddImplicitPopup.lua. A custom rare helmet without influence: "Add Implicit..." opens the
# popup with the Custom source only (source disabled, the modifier dropdowns hidden, height 110,
# the custom edit as the default control); type a line, hover "Add" (the AddItemTooltip stand-in
# of addModifier), "Add". Set the Searing Exarch influence and reopen: the Searing Exarch source
# first (buildMods: the item's affixes with spawn weight, grouped, sorted, relabelled; height
# 130); hover the Modifier box (AddModComparisonTooltip through the calc); switch the source to
# Custom and back (the selFunc's two branches: modSelectLabel.y, buildMods, SetSel, and the
# Default-sort applySort: both table.sorts, UpdateSearch); drop the Modifier list and pick its
# second entry; "Add" (the Eldritch implicit). The power sort is d_enchant's (here it would run
# the calc for every Eldritch mod on both sides: minutes through the bridge).
# The Type dropdown is never hovered: its tooltip lists a group's first `pairs` mod (module docs).
#! u36-expect Add Implicit to Item
#! u36-expect Searing Exarch
#! u36-expect +10 to Strength
